   "reviews": [
    {
     "inning": 2,
     "over": 1.1,
     "text": "Mohammed Siraj to Tim Seifert, no run, huge appeal for a possible strangle down the leg side as Kishan dives to his left and takes the catch. There was a noise, but it might have come off the pad. India have decided to go for the review. Comes in sharply from "
    },
    {
     "inning": 2,
     "over": 38.2,
     "text": "Naman Dhir to Kristian Clarke, no run, Kristian Clarke has been given OUT  Mitchell Santner prods his partner to review, was it heading down leg? Was pushed through quicker and drifted onto the right-hander - Clarke was deep in the crease and played all around"
    },
    {
